        {
          "id": "codex-nai5_community_pack_suozhang_0190",
          "alias": "韩网整理 387",
          "prompt": "1.0::artist:blue gk ::,0.2::artist:gujianshaonu ::,1.0::artist:Re0n ::,1.5::artist:firstw1 ::,0.5::choujiroo::, 0.2::artist:freng ::, 0.8::artist:kurono mitsuki ::, 0.7::artist:shigure s ::,0.3::artist:xipa ::,0.1::artist:taesi::,1.5::artist: liduke::,0.4::yoongonji::,1::artist:great mosu::,year 2026,1.5::realistic texture, smooth gradients, detailed shading::,1.5::depthness::,2::shiny body::,shiny skin,1.15::big eyes::,-1::multiple views::,\namazing quality,masterpiece,\n\n1 girl, full body, danganronpa, kirigiri kyoko, medium breasts, monokuma, \n\nKyoko Kirigiri from Danganronpa is seated on a school chair behind her school desk, with both the desk and chair positioned together on the moving conveyor belt in the center of the After School Lesson execution classroom. The conveyor belt has carried the entire desk and chair into the crushing chamber at the rear of the classroom.\n\nKyoko remains seated in the chair behind the desk. She does not stand up and does not leave the chair. She tilts her head far backward and looks almost vertically upward at the enormous crushing plate suspended high above her.\n\nThe trash compactor is an absolutely massive piece of industrial machinery built into the rear wall and ceiling of the execution chamber, not a small standalone press. Its crushing plate is several times wider than Kyoko, the school desk, and the chair combined. The huge rectangular metal platen spans nearly the entire width of the conveyor belt and crushing chamber. Thick structural beams, enormous hydraulic columns, heavy mechanical supports, and industrial machinery extend upward toward the ceiling around it.\n\nThe crushing plate is still positioned high overhead, several body-heights above Kyoko. There is a large vertical space between Kyoko and the underside of the press, making its immense size and height obvious. The machine has not yet descended close to her head. Kyoko is directly underneath the center of the enormous platen, staring upward at its vast flat underside while waiting for it to begin descending.\n\nThe camera is placed very low in front of Kyoko, approximately at the height of the school desk or slightly below it, and points steeply upward. The perspective exaggerates the vertical scale of the chamber. Kyoko, the chair, and the school desk occupy the lower portion of the image, while the enormous elevated underside of the crushing plate dominates the upper half of the composition. The viewer should clearly see the great distance upward from Kyoko's face to the press and understand that the machine is gigantic.\n\nThe underside of the press should appear like a huge flat flesh panel with tentacles on the surface rather than a small metal block. Its edges extend far beyond Kyoko on both sides and partly disappear outside the frame because of its enormous width. Massive hydraulic mechanisms and vertical supports rise above and around the flesh plate, emphasizing that this is a gigantic room-sized trash compactor.\n\nKyoko's long lavender hair falls behind the chair as she tilts her face upward. Her eyes are directed straight toward the center of the enormous metal underside above her. Her expression remains restrained and controlled but intensely focused on the machine.\n\nPreserve the recognizable After School Lesson execution setting: the school desk directly in front of Kyoko, the school chair she is seated on, the conveyor belt carrying both of them, rows of classroom desks farther away, the execution classroom environment, Monokuma acting as the teacher, and the large industrial trash compactor occupying the rear of the room.\n\nThe composition depicts the suspenseful moment before the enormous press begins its final descent. Do not show the impact or aftermath.",
          "description": "",
